# Redirects for kevinminn.com
# Format: /from-path /to-path 301
#
# www.kevinminn.com -> kevinminn.com cannot live here. Workers static assets
# reject domain-level rules in _redirects, so it is a Cloudflare redirect rule
# plus a proxied www DNS record instead. Both are written out in docs/DEPLOY.md,
# with src/middleware.ts covering whatever reaches the worker itself.

# /ventures was split into two pages
/ventures /sltr-digital 301
/ventures/ /sltr-digital 301

# /about was removed
/about / 301
/about/ / 301

# /book is the short link used in published copy for the signup page
/book /notify 301
/book/ /notify 301
